    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/1780886895a9e603e7dba80e5e105dd7.poster.avif?t=1754568598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/1780886895a9e603e7dba80e5e105dd7.webm?t=1754568598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/1780886895a9e603e7dba80e5e105dd7.mp4?t=1754568598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Zaccaria Pinball celebrates the rich legacy of Zaccaria, the Italian pioneers of pinball. As the 3rd largest pinball manufacturer in the world during their golden years (1974\u20131987), the Zaccaria brothers (Marino, Franco, and Natale) crafted over 35 iconic machines that captivated arcade enthusiasts worldwide. Faithful recreations of over 35 Zaccaria tables, designed to preserve their timeless appeal. Enhanced visuals with modern lighting, shadows, and graphical upgrades.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/97ae476510be3390b98214da2c21d622.avif?t=1754568598\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play Zaccaria Pinball and experience the thrill of classic pinball completely free!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump straight into the <strong>Time Machine</strong> table at no cost. Love the style? Unlock its <strong>Retro version</strong> simply by joining the<strong> Zaccaria Pinball Community Page</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want more? With <strong>over 140+ constantly expanding pinball tables</strong>, you can try them all unlimited time in<strong> trial mode</strong>, with a score limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready for the ultimate challenge? <strong>Story Mode</strong> takes you on a journey through <strong>42 uniquely designed pinball tables</strong>, each presenting unique challenges. Climb the leaderboard and unlock at least <strong>45 achievements</strong> as you master the <strong>Story Mode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And for the complete retro experience, dive into <strong>6 video games</strong> that will transport you back in time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/2ab9f05fba3b238f1d7cb762e8b09603.poster.avif?t=1754568598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/2ab9f05fba3b238f1d7cb762e8b09603.webm?t=1754568598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/2ab9f05fba3b238f1d7cb762e8b09603.mp4?t=1754568598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/99f0ea9cf67e8f1661e08a69ced7ab81.avif?t=1754568598\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VR Support</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in pinball like never before with <strong>full VR support.</strong> (Zaccaria Pinball - VR DLC required.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Local Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Hotseat <strong>up to 4 players</strong> in Classic game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer Mode</strong> \u2013 <strong>Challenge</strong> your <strong>friends online</strong>, just like in the <strong>golden age</strong> of arcade halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free to Play Content</strong> \u2013 Enjoy the <strong>Time Machine</strong> table completely free! Try all other tables in <strong>trial mode</strong> with score limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Authentic Pinball Experience</strong> \u2013 Play highly detailed <strong>Zaccaria pinball tables</strong> with <strong>original rules, sounds, </strong>and <strong>voiceovers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stunning Visuals</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in breathtaking <strong>lighting</strong>, dynamic <strong>shadows</strong>, realistic <strong>reflections</strong>, and mesmerizing <strong>glow </strong>effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Realistic &amp; Customizable Physics</strong> \u2013 Fine-tuned physics engine with <strong>accurate ball movement</strong>, <strong>flipper action</strong>, and <strong>table behavior</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Physics Modes</strong> \u2013 Choose from <strong>Arcade, Simulation, </strong>and <strong>Custom Mode</strong> to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Choose from <strong>seven unique game modes</strong> to test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Camera Editor</strong> \u2013 Customize your view with <strong>4 custom camera angles</strong> or pick from <strong>3 standard presets</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Global Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Compete with players worldwide! <strong>Every game, game mode </strong>and <strong>physics mode</strong> has its <strong>own dedicated leaderboard</strong>, so you can prove your skills in any category.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/56790c23adcc2b2f71303812c651ffd0.poster.avif?t=1754568598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/56790c23adcc2b2f71303812c651ffd0.webm?t=1754568598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/56790c23adcc2b2f71303812c651ffd0.mp4?t=1754568598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/efc7ae3faf29d597546e514a567d0b88.avif?t=1754568598\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover a pinball experience for every era and style!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zaccaria Tables</strong> \u2013 Authentic recreations of <strong>classic Zaccaria pinball tables</strong>, featuring <strong>original rules, sounds, </strong>and <strong>voiceovers</strong> straight from the golden age of pinball. These tables can be purchased separately as DLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro Tables</strong> \u2013 A nostalgic journey back to the <strong>1950s</strong>, featuring <strong>simplified designs</strong> and a charming vintage aesthetic. Retro tables can be unlocked by purchasing Solid-State or Electro-Mechanical pinball tables with the same name or purchasing the <strong>Zaccaria Pinball - 40 Retro Tables DLC.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Remake Tables</strong> \u2013 Classic Zaccaria tables, <strong>reimagined with a 90s twist!</strong> Enjoy bold visuals, enhanced gameplay, and a fresh take on timeless designs. These tables can be purchased separately as DLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deluxe Tables</strong> \u2013 Next-level pinball innovation! These <strong>modern creations</strong> introduce <strong>dynamic gameplay mechanics, cutting-edge visuals, </strong>and <strong>thrilling challenges</strong>. These tables can be purchased separately as DLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Award Tables</strong> \u2013 Minimalist pinball tables that you can <strong>unlock by completing achievements</strong> or by purchasing the <strong>Zaccaria Pinball - Achievement Table Pack DLC</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zombie Invasion</strong> \u2013 Not your average pinball! Face <strong>waves of zombies</strong> on a custom-designed table, using <strong>thunder strikes, rockets, </strong>and <strong>powerful attacks</strong> to survive. Are you ready for the undead onslaught?<strong> (Zaccaria Pinball - Zombie Invasion Mode DLC required for access.)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/82f6089196bea7937c433207245d52e1.poster.avif?t=1754568598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/82f6089196bea7937c433207245d52e1.webm?t=1754568598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/82f6089196bea7937c433207245d52e1.mp4?t=1754568598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/8b324abb98c1372ad35e7e50d529bfc8.avif?t=1754568598\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Graphics Tweaks</strong> \u2013 Adjust <strong>lighting, reflections, glow, particles, motion blur, environment and more</strong> to match your style.<br><strong>Physics Tweaks</strong> \u2013 Customize <strong>flipper strength</strong>, <strong>ball elasticity</strong>, <strong>bumper force</strong>, <strong>velocity</strong>, and other physics settings.<br><strong>Camera Adjustments</strong> \u2013 Fine-tune <strong>camera angles</strong> for the <strong>perfect pinball perspective</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zaccaria Pinball - Bronze Pack DLC required for full access.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/c1fb1ce83f0c8218396754e34ae04d80.poster.avif?t=1754568598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/c1fb1ce83f0c8218396754e34ae04d80.webm?t=1754568598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/c1fb1ce83f0c8218396754e34ae04d80.mp4?t=1754568598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/1bff76891a8a58888e4b19f07bc24b20.avif?t=1754568598\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
