de</strong>, with a score limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready for the ultimate challenge? <strong>Story Mode</strong> takes you on a journey through <strong>42 uniquely designed pinball tables</strong>, each presenting unique challenges. Climb the leaderboard and unlock at least <strong>45 achievements</strong> as you master the <strong>Story Mode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And for the complete retro experience, dive into <strong>6 video games</strong> that will transport you back in time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/2ab9f05fba3b238f1d7cb762e8b09603.poster.avif?t=1754568598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/2ab9f05fba3b238f1d7cb762e8b09603.webm?t=1754568598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/2ab9f05fba3b238f1d7cb762e8b09603.mp4?t=1754568598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444930/extras/99f0ea9cf67e8f1661e08a69ced7ab81.avif?t=1754568598\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VR Support</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in pinball like never before with <strong>full VR support.</strong> (Zaccaria Pinball - VR DLC required.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Local Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Hotseat <strong>up to 4 players</strong> in Classic game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer Mode</strong> \u2013 <strong>Challenge</strong> your <strong>friends online</strong>, just like in the <strong>golden age</strong> of arcade halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free to Play Content</s